00:12:25,263 --> 00:12:31,263
Nine is a drama, music, romance film directed by Rob Marshall.

3
00:18:37,894 --> 00:18:43,894
Arrogant, self-centered movie director Guido Contini finds himself struggling to
find meaning, purpose, and a script for his latest film endeavor.

4
00:24:50,526 --> 00:24:56,526
With only a week left before shooting begins, he desperately searches for answers and
inspiration from his wife, his mistress, his muse, and his mother.

5
00:31:03,157 --> 00:31:09,157
Guido Contini, played by Daniel Day-Lewis.

6
00:37:15,789 --> 00:37:21,789
Luisa Contini, played by Marion Cotillard.

7
